Regular-82\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(59.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\" transform=\"translate(80.8125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_14\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(141.413026 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\" d=\"M 3174 2259 Q 3174 2176 3072 2176 L 480 2170 Q 435 2170 416 2189 Q 397 2208 397 2246 L 397 2522 Q 397 2598 454 2598 L 3110 2598 Q 3174 2598 3174 2534 L 3174 2259 z\nM 1664 998 Q 1574 998 1574 1101 L 1568 3693 Q 1568 3744 1587 3760 Q 1606 3776 1645 3776 L 1920 3776 Q 1997 3776 1997 3718 L 2003 1062 Q 2003 998 1939 998 L 1664 998 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-e2\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\" transform=\"translate(55.703125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(120.609375 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-85\" transform=\"translate(141.515625 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(228.673537 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-e3\" d=\"M 3174 2259 Q 3174 2176 3072 2176 L 480 2170 Q 435 2170 416 2189 Q 397 2208 397 2246 L 397 2522 Q 397 2598 454 2598 L 3110 2598 Q 3174 2598 3174 2534 L 3174 2259 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-e3\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-83\" transform=\"translate(55.703125 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(119.796875 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(140.703125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_16\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(318.232798 76.025143) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-a9\" transform=\"translate(64.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(85.8125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"pf5ab419da2\"><rect x=\"20.391719\" y=\"9.768\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"149.688\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Yearly effect ($M)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Inventory $2.5M + fixed costs of three warehouses (3 × $1.5M = $4.5M) = $7.0M gross saving, less extra transport $3.0M = <b>$4.0M a year</b>.</p>"},{"q":"What would worry you?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>Service:</b> the 15% of stores more than 12 hours away would lose next-day delivery; prescriptions can't wait. Keep a small cross-dock or use overnight carriers there.</li> <li><b>Resilience:</b> one site means one point of failure (fire, flood, strike)</li><li><b>Transition:</b> moving stock without gaps on shelves</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Consolidate, but keep a small hub for distant stores. One warehouse needs about half the safety stock ($10M instead of $20M), saving about $2.5M a year, and closing three sites saves $4.5M; after $3M of extra transport, the net saving is about $4.0M a year. The 15% of stores more than 12 hours from Sydney would lose next-day delivery, so serve them through a cross-dock or overnight carrier. Risk: one site is a single point of failure, so agree a backup site. Next step: model delivery times store by store.","great":["Applies risk pooling (square-root law) with its assumptions","Nets inventory and fixed savings against transport","Protects service for distant stores","Raises resilience"],"id":88,"slug":"coral-pharmacy"}